# The middle of three gates. `complete:fast` is type-check, lint and format check; this adds the
# unit suite; `complete:check` adds `vite build` and the full Cypress e2e run on top.
#
# Around 25 seconds, which is the point: a hook slow enough to be worth skipping gets skipped, and
# a hook that gets bypassed protects nothing. Vitest fits easily — 510 tests in ~6s.
#
# What stays out, deliberately: Cypress. It boots a dev server and drives a real browser, so it
# costs minutes rather than seconds, and CI already runs it as its own job.
#
# Before pushing (or opening a PR), run the full gate by hand: `npm run complete:check`.
npm run complete:commit
